<title>USA: Selfcare gets FDA OK for blood check system.</title>
<headline>Selfcare gets FDA OK for blood check system.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Selfcare Inc said Tuesday it had received notification of U.S. Food and Drug Administration clearance for its proprietary electrochemical blood glucose monitoring system.</p>
<p>The company said the clearance satisfies a key requirement in the existing arrangements between it and LifeScan Inc, a subsidiary of Johnson &amp; Johnson.</p>
<p>Selfcare said it and LifeScan anticipate entering into a revised distribution agreement soon for an advanced version of the system.</p>
</text>
